      <div><h3>Guided onboarding</h3><p>Lite investors work through a questionnaire one question at a time.</p><div class="fg"><span class="lb">Onboarding questionnaire</span><div class="ph">Screenshot 06 — placeholder</div><p class="cap">The Lite onboarding questionnaire, one question at a time.</p></div></div>
      <div><h3>Indicate interest in four steps</h3><p>Choose an account and units, sign the subscription agreement, then follow status until wire instructions appear.</p><div class="fg"><span class="lb">Indicate interest</span><div class="ph">Screenshot 07 — placeholder</div><p class="cap">The four-step indication flow, from account choice to wire instructions.</p></div></div>
