      <div><h3>Countersign and allocate</h3><p>Fund managers see subscriptions awaiting countersignature, then allocate.</p><div class="fg"><span class="lb">Countersignature queue</span><div class="ph">Screenshot 09 — placeholder</div><p class="cap">The fund manager's view of subscriptions awaiting countersignature.</p></div></div>
